   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Is there a way to create a linked brush to select a group of points/ markers in a leafletOutput object as there is for plotOutput; something like the following (failing) pseudocode?<div><br></div><div>I&#39;m thinking leafletProxy might be the answer but I can&#39;t come close to figuring it out...<br><div><br></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#800\">## ui ##</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>leafletOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;map1&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> brush </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> brushOpts</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">id </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;plot_brush&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>verbatimTextOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;info&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">## server##</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> output$map1 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> renderLeaflet</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    some_data </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> leaflet</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> addCircles</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>output$info </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> renderPrint</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    rows </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> brushedPoints</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">some_data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> input$plot_brush</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#008\">print</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">rows</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br></span></div></code></div><pre style=\"box-sizing:border-box;overflow:auto;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:13.6px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:1.45;padding:16px;border-radius:3px;word-wrap:normal;word-break:normal;color:rgb(51,51,51);background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\"><br><br></pre></div></div></div>"
    ]
