     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br><br>On Monday, November 14, 2016 at 10:37:37 AM UTC-8, Joe Cheng [RStudio] wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">No, it was supposed to happen as part of a project last month but it did not end up getting completed. I might take a look later this week but I&#39;m so strapped for time between now and mid January, so no promises.<br><br>On Monday, November 14, 2016 at 10:23:45 AM UTC-8, Dawg wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hello Joe,<div><br></div><div>did you guys ever complete the integration?</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks,</div><div>D.<br><br>On Wednesday, February 24, 2016 at 7:59:19 PM UTC-8, Joe Cheng [RStudio] wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">It&#39;s not currently possible, though it could be after Leaflet.draw plugin integration which is about half done. We&#39;re hoping to add resources to leaflet soon. <br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\">On Wed, Feb 24, 2016 at 7:49 PM ArjunaCap &lt;<a rel=\"nofollow\">mcaw...@greenstenergy.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Is there a way to create a linked brush to select a group of points/ markers in a leafletOutput object as there is for plotOutput; something like the following (failing) pseudocode?<div><br></div><div>I&#39;m thinking leafletProxy might be the answer but I can&#39;t come close to figuring it out...<br><div><br></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#800\">## ui ##</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>leafletOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;map1&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> brush </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> brushOpts</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">id </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;plot_brush&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>verbatimTextOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;info&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">## server##</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> output$map1 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> renderLeaflet</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    some_data </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> leaflet</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> addCircles</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>output$info </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> renderPrint</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    rows </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> brushedPoints</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">some_data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> input$plot_brush</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#008\">print</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">rows</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br></span></div></code></div><pre style=\"overflow:auto;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:13.6px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:1.45;padding:16px;border-radius:3px;word-wrap:normal;word-break:normal;color:rgb(51,51,51);background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\"><br><br></pre></div></div></div>\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;Shiny - Web Framework for R&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a rel=\"nofollow\">shiny-discus...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo view this discussion on the web visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/shiny-discuss/e3960d34-722b-4c0c-aee3-bc349dc1d20a%40googlegroups.com?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=footer\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/shiny-discuss/e3960d34-722b-4c0c-aee3-bc349dc1d20a%2540googlegroups.com?utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dfooter&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792391415638000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3KQmjn0JhNb5jw10ULbJx8\">https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/shiny-discuss/e3960d34-722b-4c0c-aee3-bc349dc1d20a%40googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nFor more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792391415638000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1UDJIC5HvWqebGyjbn-5Fg\">https://groups.google.com/d/optout</a>.<br>\r\n</blockquote></div>\r\n</blockquote></div></div></blockquote></div></blockquote></div>"
